# assets/container_checksums.sha256
#
# FINAL-REVIEW M3/I2. sha256 checksums of the exact local container images this
# pipeline executes, as recorded on 2026-09-13. Nothing previously recorded any
# digest or checksum for them, so a silent in-place replacement of the binaries
# the pipeline runs would have been undetectable.
#
# These are checksums of the LOCAL .sif/.img files, NOT upstream registry
# manifest digests. `singularity inspect --json` on all three does not expose
# the upstream digest; recovering those needs a registry API call and remains a
# tracked follow-up (see conf/modules.config).
#
# Verify with:
#   cd /bigdata/stajichlab/shared/singularity_cache
#   sha256sum -c /path/to/assets/container_checksums.sha256
#
# Paths are relative to the shared image store
# (params.singularity_cache_dir = /bigdata/stajichlab/shared/singularity_cache).
#
# Permissions note: the two GATK/snpEff .img files were mode 0775
# (group-writable by group `stajichlab`) at review time and were tightened to
# 0750 in this fix round. bcftools_samtools-1.24.sif was already 0750.

7ceb30cffe1ca00f65b38cfd76d31c20972a82a45871cca4f1d5ddb182b38f1d  bcftools_samtools-1.24.sif
9a8c2b717d7656c7cc88f2007078043e1d2537bd385b289ff781933600494151  depot.galaxyproject.org-singularity-broadinstitute-gatk-4.5.0.0.img
